{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H3GramArithmetic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.H3GramArithmetic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H2GramArithmetic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h3_qFactorial_pos_of_one_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h3_qFactorial_pos_of_one_lt","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H3GramArithmetic.lean#L58-L64","doc":"**The real substrate is generic at rank 3 (sorry-free).**  For `q > 1`\n(in particular the substrate `q₀ ≈ 1.10998`), `[3]_q! > 0`, so `H_3(q)`\npasses the parameter side of Wenzl's criterion — both `1 + q` and\n`1 + q + q²` are strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h3_qFactorial_ne_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h3_qFactorial_ne_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H3GramArithmetic.lean#L50-L56","doc":"**The `n = 3` Wenzl-genericity split (sorry-free).**  `[3]_q! ≠ 0` iff\n`q` is neither a root of `1 + x` nor of `1 + x + x²` — i.e. `q ≠ -1`\nand `q` is not a primitive cube root of unity.  This is the concrete\n`n = 3` content of `qFactorial_ne_zero_iff` (`QGeneric q 3`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.qFactorial_three_expand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.qFactorial_three_expand","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H3GramArithmetic.lean#L45-L48","doc":"**`[3]_q!` in expanded form (sorry-free):** `1 + 2q + 2q² + q³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.qFactorial_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.qFactorial_three","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H3GramArithmetic.lean#L37-L43","doc":"`[3]_q! = (1 + q)(1 + q + q²)` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.qInt_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.qInt_three","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H3GramArithmetic.lean#L33-L35","doc":"`[3]_q = 1 + q + q²` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0}]}